A block that opens a tight item is written on the marker line

```
- > p
+
> z
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>p</p></blockquote>
    <blockquote><p>z</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- +
> p
+
> z
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>p</p></blockquote>
    <blockquote><p>z</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
> - | a |
>   | b |
> +
> | c |
> | d |
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>a</td></tr>
          <tr><td>b</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>c</td></tr>
          <tr><td>d</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```
